# This repo is documentation plus MHL_VERIFY_CODE, a deliberate source snapshot.
# Keep this list narrow: a stock Xcode template would exclude things committed here
# on purpose — the shared scheme under xcshareddata/, the guide PDFs, and the asset
# PNGs. Ignore only what is genuinely machine-local or regenerated.

# macOS
.DS_Store
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes

# Xcode — per-user state and build output, never shared
xcuserdata/
*.xcuserstate
DerivedData/
build/
.build/
*.xcworkspace/xcuserdata/
